o-text-raise: 0.0pt\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">①</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">학칙의 개정은 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">교수회 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">구성원 과반수</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">또는 총장이 발의하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.8pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">총장은</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이를 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">주 이상 기간을 공고하여야 한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">다만</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">,</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">긴급을 요하는 경우나 상위법령 등에</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">의하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">정하여진 경우에는 공고 절차를 거치지 아니</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">할 수 있다</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12pt; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\">②</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">총장은 학칙개정안이 공고된 날로부터</span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt\"> </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">3</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">주일</span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">이내에 교무회의의 심의를 거쳐</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조\"> </span><